msgstr "添加"

msgid "Add to blacklist"
msgstr "加入黑名单"

msgid "Available version"
msgstr "可更新版本"

msgid "Backend call failed"
msgstr "后端调用失败"

msgid "Batch Package Update"
msgstr "批量软件包更新"

msgid "Batch Update"
msgstr "批量更新"

msgid "Blacklist"
msgstr "黑名单"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Confirm batch upgrade"
msgstr "确认批量升级"

msgid "Confirm upgrade"
msgstr "确认升级"

msgid "Currently upgrading"
msgstr "正在升级"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "Finished"
msgstr "已完成"

msgid "Idle"
msgstr "空闲"

msgid "Installed version"
msgstr "当前版本"

msgid "No supported package manager (opkg or apk) was found on this system."
msgstr "未在此系统上找到受支持的包管理器（opkg 或 apk）。"

msgid "No upgradable packages found."
msgstr "没有可更新的软件包。"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

msgid "Package"
msgstr "软件包"

msgid "Package name"
msgstr "软件包名称"

msgid "Package upgrades"
msgstr "软件包升级"

msgid ""
"Packages on the blacklist are never upgraded, neither by one-click batch "
"upgrades nor by single package upgrades."
msgstr ""
"黑名单中的软件包永远不会被升级：无论是一键批量升级还是单独升级都会被"
"跳过。"

msgid "Refresh package list"
msgstr "刷新软件包列表"

msgid "Refreshing"
msgstr "正在刷新"

msgid "Remove from blacklist"
msgstr "移出黑名单"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid ""
"The backend helper is unavailable. Please check that /usr/bin/batchupdate "
"is installed and executable."
msgstr "后端脚本不可用。请检查 /usr/bin/batchupdate 是否已安装且具有可执行权限。"

msgid "The blacklist is empty."
msgstr "黑名单为空。"

msgid "There is nothing to upgrade."
msgstr "没有需要升级的软件包。"

msgid "This will upgrade %d packages. Blacklisted packages are skipped. Continue?"
msgstr "即将升级 %d 个软件包，黑名单中的软件包会被跳过。是否继续？"

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升级"

msgid "Upgrade all packages"
msgstr "一键升级全部"

msgid ""
"Upgrade all upgradable packages at once. Packages on the blacklist are "
"always skipped."
msgstr "一键升级所有可更新的软件包。黑名单中的软件包会被自动跳过。"

msgid "Upgrade package \"%s\"?"
msgstr "确定要升级软件包“%s”吗？"

msgid "Upgraded: %d, failed: %d, skipped: %d"
msgstr "已升级：%d，失败：%d，跳过：%d"

msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "升级中"

msgid ""
"Warning: upgrading packages on a running system may cause instability or "
"even soft-brick the device. Use with caution and make sure there is enough "
"free flash space."
msgstr ""
"警告：在运行中的系统上升级软件包可能导致系统不稳定甚至变砖。请谨慎操"
"作，并确保闪存剩余空间充足。"

msgid "blacklisted"
msgstr "已拉黑"
